[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、あなたも店を出すのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, so you're setting up a stall too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。ミーケちゃんと一緒に、ララ・キングダムで\n作った衣服や装飾品を売るつもりです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Mieke and I plan to sell clothing and accessories made in the Kingdom of Lara."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ディオーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こちらもラランで取引できるように\nするということですよね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're supposed to accept Lalan for transactions as well, correct?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ディオーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。しかも、入場時にもらえる金額では\n買えない値段に設定してね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right. And make sure to price everything higher than what people receive at the entrance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたたちの作品を買いたいという客はたくさんいる。\nみんなどんどん換金してくれることになるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There will be plenty of customers who want to buy your creations. They'll keep exchanging more Col for Lalan."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど……よく考えられているのですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see... It's very well thought out."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ディオーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……あら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Oh my."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "？\u3000どうかされましたか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "? What's wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ディオーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "向こうのほうから魔物の気配がするわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I sense monsters coming from over there."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当ですか！\n倒して参ります！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really?! I'll go defeat them!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ディオーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（人の賑わいに釣られて\n\u3000引き寄せられた……というところかしら）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(They must have been drawn here by all the commotion from the crowds.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（計画を邪魔されるわけにはいかない。私のほうでも\n\u3000近くにいる魔物は倒しておきましょうか）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I can't let them interfere with our plans. I should take care of any nearby monsters myself.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふう……これで大方片付いたかしら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew... That should take care of most of them."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ！\u3000あんた、なんでこんな所に！\n捕まってるんじゃなかったの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey! What are you doing here?! Weren't you supposed to be captured?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、あなたは。レスナに付きまとっている子ね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, you're that girl who follows Resna around."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そんなんじゃないわよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-It's not like that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（頭に血を上らせているようね。\n\u3000その怒りをぶつける相手を与えてやりましょうか）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(She's getting all worked up. Perhaps I should give her anger a proper target.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ところで、あなたも見たかしら？\nこの浜に巣くう魔物を",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By the way, did you happen to see the monsters lurking around this beach?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私のほうでもだいぶ倒したのだけど、\nまだ残っているようね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I defeated quite a few myself, but it seems there are still some left."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いくら天才でも、見逃しがあるってことね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I suppose even a genius can miss a few."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ！？\u3000ふざけるんじゃないわよ！\n天才に見逃しはないわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What?! Don't mess with me! A genius doesn't miss anything!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（これぐらい焚き付けておけば、\n\u3000あとは勝手にやってくれるわね）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(That should be enough provocation. She'll handle the rest on her own.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クリセルダ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、アンチュ。どうしたの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, Antje. What is it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "グランプリに参加するだけでいいの？\nもっと役に立てる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is just participating in the Grand Prix enough? Can I be more useful?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなに気負うことはないわ。\n優勝を目指してなんて言わないから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You don't need to push yourself so hard. I'm not asking you to aim for victory."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、アンチュには本気で勝負はしてほしいの。\nそのほうが、盛り上がるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I do want you to compete seriously, Antje. It'll make things more exciting."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "盛り上がる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Exciting?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。このグランプリはね。\n盛り上がることが大事なのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. You see, excitement is what matters most in this Grand Prix."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうなんだ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（さて、今日できることはこれくらいね）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Well, that's about all I can accomplish today.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（いよいよ、明日からグランプリが始まる。\n\u3000楽しみだわ……ふふ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(At last, the Grand Prix begins tomorrow. How thrilling... hehe.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（待ちに待ったグランプリ当日。\n\u3000さあ、行動開始よ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The long-awaited Grand Prix day has arrived. Time to put the plan into action.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（まずは観客が集まっている場所を目指しましょう）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(First, I should head to where the spectators are gathering.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]